{
  "$comment": "One rule set for both pre-flight sandboxes: apps/orchestrator/src/preflight/local.ts (via packages/catalog/src/preflight-rules.ts) and modal-sandbox/contextpane_sandbox.py (copied into the Modal image). Every rule here is a hard failure. Command names are lower-case; destructivePatterns are case-insensitive regular expressions valid in both JavaScript and Python.",
